tile.laziestae2.machine.aggregator.tooltip=Automates in-world fluix crystal crafting.
tile.laziestae2.machine.aggregator.tooltip.2=Combines three ingredients into one output.
tile.laziestae2.machine.aggregator.tooltip.3=Accepts acceleration cards.
tile.laziestae2.machine.centrifuge.tooltip=Purifies crystals without water or waiting.
tile.laziestae2.machine.centrifuge.tooltip.2=Also grinds sky stone, ender pearls and wheat.
tile.laziestae2.machine.centrifuge.tooltip.3=Accepts acceleration cards.
tile.laziestae2.machine.etcher.tooltip=Prints processors without inscriber presses.
tile.laziestae2.machine.etcher.tooltip.2=Takes redstone, silicon and a core material.
tile.laziestae2.machine.etcher.tooltip.3=Accepts acceleration cards.
tile.laziestae2.machine.energizer.tooltip=Charges certus quartz faster than a charger.
tile.laziestae2.machine.energizer.tooltip.2=Energy cost is set by the recipe.
tile.laziestae2.machine.energizer.tooltip.3=Accepts acceleration cards.
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip=Feeds a crafting machine from the ME network.
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.2=Holds patterns and pushes their ingredients
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.3=into inventories on faces set to output,
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.4=grabbing a whole batch at once where it can.
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.5=Place a crafter, such as a Molecular Assembler,
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.6=against an output face; pipe results back into
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.7=the import buffer to return them to the network.
tile.laziestae2.machine.fast_crafter.tooltip.8=Requires an ME channel.
tile.laziestae2.machine.level_maintainer.tooltip=Keeps items stocked in the ME network.
tile.laziestae2.machine.level_maintainer.tooltip.2=Set a target quantity and batch size per row.
tile.laziestae2.machine.level_maintainer.tooltip.3=Requires an ME channel and a crafting CPU.

tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.controller.tooltip=Core of the Mass Assembly Chamber.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.controller.tooltip.2=Accepts crafting jobs in bulk and works
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.controller.tooltip.3=through them using network power.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.controller.tooltip.4=Requires an ME channel.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.frame.tooltip=Structural block for the Mass Assembly Chamber.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.vent.tooltip=Decorative casing for the Mass Assembly Chamber.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.module_pattern.tooltip=Holds up to 36 crafting patterns for the
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.module_pattern.tooltip.2=Mass Assembly Chamber. Right-click to open.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.module_cpu.tooltip=Increases assembly speed, at the cost of
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.module_cpu.tooltip.2=more energy per unit of work.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.io_port.tooltip=Pattern access for the Mass Assembly Chamber.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.io_port.tooltip.2=Hoppers and pipes can insert or extract
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.io_port.tooltip.3=encoded patterns through it.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.io_port.tooltip.4=Accepts patterns only, not crafting ingredients.
tile.laziestae2.big_assembler.io_port.tooltip.5=Required for the structure to form.

